      "kind": "frustration",
      "claim": "A seller expresses extreme frustration with eBay's lack of enforcement against non-paying bidders, particularly for high-value trading cards, reporting that at least one in three buyers do not pay.",
      "speaker_role": "seller",
      "evidence_ids": ["R1"],
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "kind": "platform_mechanic",
